    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Evolvania</i>\u00a0you embody a mysterious, wandering eye on a quest to seize  eyedrops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture deep into a colossal creature and discover the mysterious secrets it holds. Explore every corner and crevice hand-drawn with vivid, gruesome detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/0d3fa4c20b6c04114dc3ebae9ad5db10.poster.avif?t=1754060144\" width=600 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/0d3fa4c20b6c04114dc3ebae9ad5db10.webm?t=1754060144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/0d3fa4c20b6c04114dc3ebae9ad5db10.mp4?t=1754060144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Haunting, Handcrafted World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a bizarre interior landscape of a colossal beast. Every dripping detail and splatter tells a story waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/6c03529a6080acd4e52f5cc63ad938e9.poster.avif?t=1754060144\" width=600 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/6c03529a6080acd4e52f5cc63ad938e9.webm?t=1754060144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/6c03529a6080acd4e52f5cc63ad938e9.mp4?t=1754060144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Revolutionary Combat &amp; Fusion Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience classic 2D metroidvania action with a twist. Use the different <strong>combinations</strong> to experiment and unlock new gruesome abilities and passages within the game world. Evolve in something new: better, faster and stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/63f77ecc2b58d5f0faf424fa4d426a0a.poster.avif?t=1754060144\" width=600 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/63f77ecc2b58d5f0faf424fa4d426a0a.webm?t=1754060144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/63f77ecc2b58d5f0faf424fa4d426a0a.mp4?t=1754060144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse and Thrilling Foes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a range of enemies, each with its own unique challenge. Learn their secrets, adapt your strategies, and devour them one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/b3ad1274f8607336dd90be88956e9389.poster.avif?t=1754060144\" width=600 height=650 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/b3ad1274f8607336dd90be88956e9389.webm?t=1754060144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/b3ad1274f8607336dd90be88956e9389.mp4?t=1754060144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Your Own Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With our intuitive level editor, transform your journey into a sandbox of creativity. Build your own metroidvania adventure and creatures using all the elements you've encountered in the main adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world that blends visceral atmosphere with inventive gameplay, where every step forward deepens the mystery of your very existence. Every encounter is an opportunity to evolve.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Evolvania</i>\u00a0you embody a mysterious, wandering eye on a quest to seize  eyedrops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture deep into a colossal creature and discover the mysterious secrets it holds. Explore every corner and crevice hand-drawn with vivid, gruesome detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/0d3fa4c20b6c04114dc3ebae9ad5db10.poster.avif?t=1754060144\" width=600 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/0d3fa4c20b6c04114dc3ebae9ad5db10.webm?t=1754060144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/0d3fa4c20b6c04114dc3ebae9ad5db10.mp4?t=1754060144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Haunting, Handcrafted World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a bizarre interior landscape of a colossal beast. Every dripping detail and splatter tells a story waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/6c03529a6080acd4e52f5cc63ad938e9.poster.avif?t=1754060144\" width=600 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/6c03529a6080acd4e52f5cc63ad938e9.webm?t=1754060144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/6c03529a6080acd4e52f5cc63ad938e9.mp4?t=1754060144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Revolutionary Combat &amp; Fusion Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience classic 2D metroidvania action with a twist. Use the different <strong>combinations</strong> to experiment and unlock new gruesome abilities and passages within the game world. Evolve in something new: better, faster and stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/63f77ecc2b58d5f0faf424fa4d426a0a.poster.avif?t=1754060144\" width=600 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/63f77ecc2b58d5f0faf424fa4d426a0a.webm?t=1754060144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/63f77ecc2b58d5f0faf424fa4d426a0a.mp4?t=1754060144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse and Thrilling Foes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a range of enemies, each with its own unique challenge. Learn their secrets, adapt your strategies, and devour them one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/b3ad1274f8607336dd90be88956e9389.poster.avif?t=1754060144\" width=600 height=650 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/b3ad1274f8607336dd90be88956e9389.webm?t=1754060144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/b3ad1274f8607336dd90be88956e9389.mp4?t=1754060144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Your Own Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With our intuitive level editor, transform your journey into a sandbox of creativity. Build your own metroidvania adventure and creatures using all the elements you've encountered in the main adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world that blends visceral atmosphere with inventive gameplay, where every step forward deepens the mystery of your very existence. Every encounter is an opportunity to evolve.</p>",
    "short_description": "Venture into a colossal creature by merging with the environment and enemies. Evolve and acquire new powers. Evolvania is an hand-drawn metroidvania in which you can play a breathtaking adventure or create your own with a special level editor.",
